# Alembic
# Migration files MUST be tracked in git — they are copied into the container
# (backend/Dockerfile COPY backend/alembic ./alembic) and applied on startup
# via `alembic upgrade head`. Ignoring them would silently skip schema changes.
backend/alembic/versions/*.pyc

